e point lies *on* the $y$-axis, $9$ units *below* the origin in the *negative* direction of the $y$-axis. So, the point has an $x$-coordinate of $0,$ and a $y$-coordinate of $-9.$\n\nTherefore, its coordinates are $(0,-9).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fa4447cd-bfec-5206-a4ca-3324b2450d3d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fa4447cd-bfec-5206-a4ca-3324b2450d3d" :answer-field/id #uuid "fa4447cd-bfec-5206-a4ca-3324b2450d3d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8e20b9db-a562-5945-9004-2bc374677ab1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e246ba60-b376-57f3-b778-e87835efe925" "answer-e180a660-c93d-5a4e-8c21-ed6cf3dc7953" "answer-8e20b9db-a562-5945-9004-2bc374677ab1" "answer-a60eed74-e518-5b3c-9d57-d147de5e54ae" "answer-10aaf516-d373-5752-826b-107fe39214d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e246ba60-b376-57f3-b778-e87835efe925" :answer/id #uuid "e246ba60-b376-57f3-b778-e87835efe925" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e180a660-c93d-5a4e-8c21-ed6cf3dc7953" :answer/id #uuid "e180a660-c93d-5a4e-8c21-ed6cf3dc7953" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-9,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8e20b9db-a562-5945-9004-2bc374677ab1" :answer/id #uuid "8e20b9db-a562-5945-9004-2bc374677ab1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a60eed74-e518-5b3c-9d57-d147de5e54ae" :answer/id #uuid "a60eed74-e518-5b3c-9d57-d147de5e54ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-10aaf516-d373-5752-826b-107fe39214d3" :answer/id #uuid "10aaf516-d373-5752-826b-107fe39214d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(9,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-373c04e2-db02-5c16-a78f-083cd4605e08" :question/id #uuid "373c04e2-db02-5c16-a78f-083cd4605e08" :question/math-academy-id "q-12470" :question/problem "![](images/d0/d0785d11a903993b04ee55c7fc23f8f219280a45b66df759cbadc1d42fc8c418.png)\n\nWhat are the $xy$-coordinates of the point shown in the axes above?" :question/worked-solution "To find the coordinates of the point, we inspect its position along the $x$ and $y$ axes.\n\nThe point is $2$ units to the right of the origin, in the positive direction of the $x$-axis. So, the point has an $x$-coordinate of $2.$\n\nAdditionally, the point is $4$ units above the origin, in the positive direction of the $y$-axis. So, the point has a $y$-coordinate of $4.$\n\nThe point has an $x$-coordinate of $2$ and a $y$-coordinate of $4,$ so its coordinates are $(2,4).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-073ba61f-9550-5c17-92c4-d58bbcf59d56"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-073ba61f-9550-5c17-92c4-d58bbcf59d56" :answer-field/id #uuid "073ba61f-9550-5c17-92c4-d58bbcf59d56" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4164de67-68ed-5d58-baf5-fb09924a32e7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-011074f1-cfd6-58bf-a370-02a373de9fcb" "answer-aa17eba7-c7a7-520c-99a2-7d560eb3244c" "answer-45e3c289-b652-569a-b906-41ad803f5ec3" "answer-4164de67-68ed-5d58-baf5-fb09924a32e7" "answer-88d57ad0-69ba-527a-ab06-91ea89cb74df"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-011074f1-cfd6-58bf-a370-02a373de9fcb" :answer/id #uuid "011074f1-cfd6-58bf-a370-02a373de9fcb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,-4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aa17eba7-c7a7-520c-99a2-7d560eb3244c" :answer/id #uuid "aa17eba7-c7a7-520c-99a2-7d560eb3244c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45e3c289-b652-569a-b906-41ad803f5ec3" :answer/id #uuid "45e3c289-b652-569a-b906-41ad803f5ec3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "